er":false,"text":"违反管制的学生会给她送到学生会，但是学生会对这些学生的惩罚总是很轻，因此她本人也对其感到很不满。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"也因此造成了现在的“学生会VS风纪委员”的局面。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着惊异的运动能力和优秀的领导能力让她拥有绝对的威严，通过和心秤相反的能力值来控制他人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着和自己的性格不相称的名字，被大家慕称为ネコ前辈（或者ニャン子），本人则希望给称为刃牙前辈。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「钢可是要比铁还硬」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23115"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f4e5a3e835459a84adf5ae8cdb7361fa7f8d2007e1a7669c4bc083787860b67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/9265eafeae8f2b6c8fa92768fcf2845e9d7061964aab3888f921bd06a986db0a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c63986","characterName":"春名 梨多","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62161","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"234211"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19735"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63986"},"originalCharacterName":"春名 梨多","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1225"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"Rita is the true heroine of the game."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63986"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"蓮太郎の幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家がお隣で、ずっと一緒だったので幼なじみというか兄妹、もしくは姉弟のような関係。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":